===============================================================================
AN HONEST NOTE (NOT LEGAL ADVICE)
===============================================================================

This license was written to be clear and to sound like what it protects —
a free, fair project — rather than to be intimidating. It isn't a
substitute for an actual lawyer's review, especially:

  - The exact penalty amount, and whether it's enforceable at face value.
    Courts in many places — including India, under Section 74 of the
    Indian Contract Act — often treat a stated penalty as a ceiling for
    "reasonable compensation" rather than an automatic exact payout.
  - Enforcement across borders, since this software can be downloaded and
    used anywhere, under different countries' laws.

If this project ever becomes commercially significant, or an actual
dispute comes up, get a real license reviewed by a lawyer licensed where
you live. Until then, this document says clearly what it means: please
don't sell this, please leave the credit, and thank you for using it.
